//? Title: Board action values and frozen policy snapshots
//? Lang: en

> Board action values and frozen policy snapshots

The board policy scores nine actions from a tic-tac-toe observation
expressed from the current player's perspective. Greedy selection
considers legal actions only. Training regresses the value of the
executed action onto its eventual outcome for that player.

Here player one has an immediate winning move at cell two. The same
labeled board trains for 40 updates. A separate policy reloads
the checkpoint from before training. Its legal action remains
the action chosen by the original policy before fitting. The plot
tracks squared outcome error for the winning action.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/board_policy.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>

int main() {
  namespace n=dm::nn;
  dm::rl::environments::TicTacToe game;
  for (int move:{0,3,1,4}) game.Apply(move);
  dm::rl::BoardValuePolicy policy, frozen(1);
  const int original=policy.greedy(game);
  frozen.load_snapshot(policy.snapshot());
  const auto x=n::from_vector(game.Observation(),{1,9});
  const auto action=n::from_vector<int>({2});
  std::vector<double> steps,loss;
  for (int i=0;i<40;++i) {
    steps.push_back(i);
    loss.push_back(policy.train(x,action,n::ones({1})));
  }
  const int fitted=policy.greedy(game);
  if (frozen.greedy(game)!=original || fitted!=2 || !(loss.back()<loss.front())) {
    throw std::runtime_error("Board fit or snapshot check failed");
  }
  std::print("The frozen policy chooses cell {} and the fitted policy chooses winning cell {}. "
             "Outcome MSE fell from {:.6f} to {:.6f}.\n",original,fitted,loss.front(),loss.back());
  std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
  auto plot=dm::graphics::RPlot::create();
  plot.lines(steps,loss,"Winning action",{37,99,235})
      .title("Fitting a board action value").x_label("Update").y_label("Squared outcome error")
      .size(800,460).save_svg("build/board_policy.svg");
}
```
// result_begin: markdown
The frozen policy chooses cell 7 and the fitted policy chooses winning cell 2. Outcome MSE fell from 1.097860 to 0.000020.
\image(figures/board_policy.svg)
